  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ki forms an invisible barrier around your body, softening impacts and shielding you from energy.</p>\n<p>While wearing no <em>Armor</em> and not wielding a <em>Shield</em>, your <strong>AC</strong> equals 10 + double your <em>Wisdom Modifier</em>+ half of your <em>Proficiency Bonus</em> (rounded up).</p>\n<p>When you are wearing <em>Armor</em> you may use your <em>Wisdom</em> in place of <em>Dexterity</em> for <strong>AC Calculation</strong>.</p>\n",
